      <p class="kick">An interactive story · One week in November</p>
      <h1 id="h0"><span>What in</span><span>the world is</span><span>happening<span class="q">?</span></span></h1>
      <p class="dek">For a week, things kept breaking in America. Email went down. Flights were grounded. A bank and an airline stalled. The systems were different, and so were the causes. But if this can happen in the United States, <strong>what could it mean for the rest of the world?</strong></p>
