        <span class="word" style="--n:7" aria-hidden="true">Outlook</span>
        <span class="when">Thu 12 Nov · Work</span>
        <h3>Microsoft goes down worldwide</h3>
        <p>Outlook, Teams and other tools fail for over 24 hours.</p>
      </article>
