    <h2 class="h2 rv d1" id="h3x" style="max-width:17ch">Not a single attack. <span class="c">Not a single explanation.</span></h2>
    <p class="lede rv d2">Each system broke in its own place. Where a cause was given, it was mundane.</p>
    <div class="mods">
      <article class="mod glass rv">
        <div class="mod-h"><h3>Microsoft</h3><span class="st ok">Cause given</span></div>
        <div class="diag"><svg viewBox="0 0 160 96" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="#3FE3F2" stroke-opacity=".5"><rect x="48" y="12" width="64" height="12" rx="2"/><rect x="48" y="28" width="64" height="12" rx="2"/><rect x="48" y="44" width="64" height="12" rx="2" stroke="#FF8A70" stroke-dasharray="3 3" stroke-opacity=".9"/><rect x="48" y="60" width="64" height="12" rx="2" stroke="#FF8A70" stroke-dasharray="3 3" stroke-opacity=".9"/><rect x="48" y="76" width="64" height="12" rx="2"/></g><g fill="#3FE3F2"><circle cx="56" cy="18" r="1.8"/><circle cx="56" cy="34" r="1.8"/><circle cx="56" cy="82" r="1.8"/></g><g fill="#FF8A70"><circle cx="56" cy="50" r="1.8"/><circle cx="56" cy="66" r="1.8"/></g><text x="120" y="58" font-family="IBM Plex Mono,monospace" font-size="7" fill="#7D93A3">SERVERS</text></svg></div>
