        <h4>Sources</h4>
        <p>Reuters, The Atlantic and TechCrunch. Official and company statements are as reported by these outlets.</p>
        <h4>Labels</h4>
        <p><span class="tag t-c">Confirmed</span> Reported as fact by the sources, or stated by the organisation affected.</p>
        <p><span class="tag t-o">Official / company</span> Explanations or assessments from government or companies. Attributed, not independently verified.</p>
